        verification storyDistributedCollabDayOneDoD : Test { :>> id = "0d620002-0812-4202-9b3e-000000120002"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::demo; :>> procedureText = "Delivers D0129's day-one set plus its governing model. MODEL: 3 Personas / 10 Needs / 13 UseCases in the DECLARED Business succession (personas->needs->useCases, business.sysml:15-21) + 20 SystemRequirements with satisfy edges + D0129 (proposed, #ProspectiveChange, supersedes d0014 on acceptance) + 2 processes with 2 deploying skills (D0059) + 11 Issues (071-081), each carrying file:line evidence. CODE/CONFIG (each closes a verified defect): issue071 ancestry-preserving integration (squash+rebase-merge DISABLED on the remote, main blocks force-push/deletion with enforce_admins, required_linear_history deliberately FALSE since linear history would mandate the rebase we forbid; post-commit integrates a rejected push by MERGE and retries with a recursion guard; pre-merge-commit added so merge commits are gated at last); issue074 new hard guard duplicate-identity (18 guards, 16 hard) over id/item-name/package-name/sequence-number, FORWARD-ONLY (18 pre-existing bootstrap duplicate ids across 26 sites grandfathered to warning, tracked issue080); issue075 gen_uuid -> OS CSPRNG UUIDv4; issue072+073 provenance never defaulted (13 write paths lost their default actor, 7 of which named a HUMAN; new `keel actor show|set` + KEEL_ACTOR + explicit flag, else REFUSE; .keel/ gitignored); issue076 portable gate (no hardcoded conda/binary paths, kernel layer optional, unrunnable check FAILS LOUDLY, *.sysml eol pinned in .gitattributes). VERIFY: clippy -D warnings clean; 146 tests pass incl. new duplicate-scan/grandfather/uuid/actor tests; keel validate + guard (all 18) + check-engine green; `keel actor` refuses an unregistered id and binds a registered one; append-result attributed to claudeOpus5 from the machine binding with NO default; committed b518c23 and CI GREEN (first green in several commits — the included two-pass fix repaired the order-dependent failure at parse_engine_files.rs:99, filed as issue079)."; }
