    verification dcRefineGate : Test { :>> id = "0d620004-0812-4204-9b3e-000000120004"; :>> title = "Sprint 247 refine gate (DoR)"; :>> createdAt = "2026-08-12"; :>> createdBy = "claudeOpus5"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::inspect; :>> procedureText = "DoR: the human directed operating keel as an async remote mostly-AI team within ~a week, asked for research into required features, for the SE chain (use cases/needs/reqs) and for a base collaboration process, then chose TWO-LANE integration and the scope 'SE chain + day-one blockers' via an explicit question. Scope fixed: SE chain + D0129 + 2 processes/skills + 5 mechanical blockers; DEFERRED with reasons — declared-marker vocabulary (frozen schema, needs sign-off), work claiming, land loop, enrollment command, unknownEvidence split, contention path, authority queue, ownership guard, duplicate-id migration. #CharteredBy d0129. estimatedPoints=8. DoR met."; }
