    verification dcStandupGate : Test { :>> id = "0d620006-0812-4206-9b3e-000000120006"; :>> title = "Sprint 247 standup gate"; :>> createdAt = "2026-08-12"; :>> createdBy = "claudeOpus5"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::inspect; :>> procedureText = "Approach: two independent research lanes first (external prior-art + internal code audit), then verify EVERY load-bearing claim against code before authoring a requirement on it — several agent claims were re-checked directly (serve.rs defaults, gen_uuid, orient evidence resolution) and one was corrected (latest sprint is 246, not 163). Author in the declared succession so use cases stay rooted. Order the blockers by blast radius under concurrency: silent corruption and false attribution before throughput. No blockers."; }
