    verification dcCloseOutGate : Test { :>> id = "0d62000c-0812-420c-9b3e-00000012000c"; :>> title = "Sprint 247 closeOut gate (autonomous, D0049)"; :>> createdAt = "2026-08-12"; :>> createdBy = "claudeOpus5"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::inspect; :>> procedureText = "Autonomous closeOut (D0049). All six delivered actions carry passing DoD TestResults judged at b518c23 (dcMergeOnlyIntegration, dcDuplicateIdentityGuard, dcCollisionResistantIds, dcActorIdentityBinding, dcPortableGate, dcTwoPassRegistration). Self-evidencing: the gates ARE cargo test / clippy / keel validate / guard / check-engine / CI, all green. Eight follow-on actions remain on the backlog (dcDeclaredMarkers, dcWorkClaim, dcLandLoop, dcEnrollment, dcUnresolvedEvidence, dcContentionAdjudication, dcAuthorityQueue, dcMechanizeOwnership) plus two repair actions (dcRepairDuplicateIds, dcStaleKernelInstanceGate). Awaiting the human's per-sitting sign-off, which must also decide D0129's acceptance (still proposed — no acceptance event was fabricated)."; }
